#: ../../modules/dump.md:1 6014a7cf066f42bb8483715d95d05679
msgid "🔬 Dump"
msgstr "🔬 转存（Dump）"

#: ../../modules/dump.md:3 ddb6c3e6ef5342eb8e9c68234a807dcd
msgid "**`#bs.dump:help`**"
msgstr "**`#bs.dump:help`**"

#: ../../modules/dump.md:5 e2719f492ef74371b70c0cfa87397e8c
msgid "The dump module provides mechanisms for printing the state of any \"variables\"."
msgstr "转存模块提供了打印任意“变量”状态的机制。"

#: ../../modules/dump.md:8 38e164c5c8f24e1f93055d1e1dd89771
msgid "Since version 26.1, Minecraft now pretty-prints NBT data in text components. As a result, this module has become less useful. The update also introduced new constraints that broke several features."
msgstr "从 26.1 版本开始，Minecraft 现在会在文本组件中美化打印 NBT 数据。因此，该模块变得不太有用。此次更新还引入了新的限制，破坏了几个功能。"

#: ../../modules/dump.md:10 fa8e8557e68440e689100053d417f834
msgid "The module is still functional, however, when concatenation is required, expand and copy operations are not available at all. A future rework is planned to improve usability and reduce complexity. For now, the priority has been to keep the module operational."
msgstr "该模块仍然可用，但在需要拼接时，展开和复制操作完全不可用。计划未来进行重做以提高可用性并降低复杂度。目前，优先级是保持模块正常运行。"

#: ../../modules/dump.md:15 82696d421f0543f49c2e12a1720d557f
msgid "🔧 Functions"
msgstr "🔧 函数"

#: ../../modules/dump.md:17 d59c5ca7765f4bd7b0702586f0c79140
msgid "You can find below all functions available in this module."
msgstr "你可以在下方找到此模块中的所有可用函数。"

#: ../../modules/dump.md:21 a1de1b39d4524eb99646f284e46ad4a7
msgid "Dump Var"
msgstr "打印变量"

#: ../../modules/dump.md:25 df20adc924da4455ab12f480a0468f6b
msgid "Dump the content of given variables to the chat."
msgstr "将给定变量的内容打印到聊天栏。"

#: ../../modules/dump.md:27 0fd2fde2058a4b1da7b513a74d97c83c
